message: "If you use SOC Shift in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SOC Shift"
abstract: "A browser-based SOC analyst shift simulator: handover, Sigma and correlation alert triage, pivoting, response, hunting, tuning with a regression check, handover out, and case exports for TheHive, DFIR-IRIS, STIX 2.1 and ATT&CK Navigator, graded against an answer key. Scenarios are synthetic."
